==Battleground==
*3 [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn, delay 6.67~26.67 seconds<sup>200f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Young Man Mola (Enemy)|Young Man Molas]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mola King (Enemy)|Mola King]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crab]] spawns.
**3 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**6 [[Tasmanian Giant Crab (Enemy)|Tasmanian Giant Crabs]] spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

